    "limitations": [
      "Selected parcel-export fields from the real 2026 combined application, not a complete CAP application, eligibility check or accepted filing payload.",
      "One mapped row is an app preparation gate only, not a government minimum or proof that all applicable rows have been supplied. Neither export table is universally required by this mapping.",
      "Each proposed fact contains one flat source row with original cell strings, unit null, campaign_year basis and period 2026. Its stable prefixed identity hash is not a physical farm parcel ID or proof of ownership.",
      "Profile minimum headers are app recognition requirements, not official mandatory-column rules. All column required flags are false because the manual does not supply those requirements.",
      "The manual documents authority CSV/Shapefile exports, not an accepted import schema, upload payload or filing API. A generated draft PDF is not a paper application.",
      "CSV dialect, encoding, nulls, numeric precision, composite-cell delimiters, geometry CRS and complete code lists remain unspecified. Unknown columns remain original source evidence.",
      "Authority filing remains the separate MyGuichet review, electronic signature, attachment and transmission workflow. App review is not authority acceptance. The manual's 2026 filing deadlines are historical campaign dates.",
      "Parcel IDs, holding IDs and crop/measure codes remain strings. Mixed-case headers and numeric headers 542, 553 and 554 retain their exact documented spelling. The agriculture variants row has no documented header; do not invent one.",
      "prev_crop denotes the previous crop year 2025 inside the 2026 dataset; it must not become the 2026 crop. Campaign provenance is not inferred from upload time.",
      "bio is the authority-recorded parcel status, not app certification or editable authority truth. The manual states it is authority-prefilled and cannot be changed in the application; app confirmation only reviews imported evidence.",
      "pa_status records the source parcel edit status N/M/A and is unrelated to the app's proposed/confirmed/rejected review status.",
      "Areas use Ar (a), not hectares. a_eligible denotes declared area after the documented wood/sewage-sludge-storage deduction, not verified eligibility. Preserve source areas; do not recalculate them from app geometry.",
      "Slope percentages must not be silently limited to 100 or treated as degrees."
    ],
